1
00:01:49,239 --> 00:01:50,599
Shift's over. Why haven't you gone home?

2
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,079
What's the matter?

3
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,879
Can't bring yourself to write it?

4
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,599
Want to take a look at the resignation letter

5
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:02,640
I wrote back in the day?

6
00:02:10,159 --> 00:02:10,680
Come walk with me.

7
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:21,680
The police force will never fight crime any less

8
00:02:22,599 --> 00:02:24,520
just because you're gone.

9
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,879
New officers will always step up

10
00:02:28,719 --> 00:02:31,680
to defend our honor and keep this city safe.

11
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:40,680
Xiao,

12
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,800
you're thinking of resigning because of Tian Xin, right?

13
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:49,080
You know about that?

14
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:53,159
I met with Tian Xin.

15
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:57,439
Her father's sacrifice took a heavy toll on her.

16
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:00,199
She doesn't want you to stay a cop,

17
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,360
which is completely understandable.

18
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:06,360
Back then, your aunt worried about my safety too.

19
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:08,360
We fought over it countless times.

20
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,719
She wanted me to find a stable job.

21
00:03:13,039 --> 00:03:16,120
I faced the exact same dilemma back then.

22
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,759
But in the end, I didn't give it up.

23
00:03:19,919 --> 00:03:20,680
Maybe...

24
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:23,560
deep down, I just refuse to give in.

25
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:26,159
I can't stand letting criminals walk free.

26
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:27,400
I know you.

27
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:29,400
You're just like me in that regard.

28
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,240
With your abilities, I know

29
00:03:32,439 --> 00:03:33,280
in any other field,

30
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,800
you'd thrive and do exceptionally well.

31
00:03:35,719 --> 00:03:37,199
But every day after that,

32
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:40,360
you might have to live with

33
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:42,159
the regret in your heart.

34
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:46,680
Of course,

35
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,400
how you choose is your right.

36
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,039
It's your freedom.

37
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,360
I'm sure our brothers on the force

38
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,120
will understand your decision, too.

39
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,840
I don't know if it's worth it for you.

40
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,479
All I know is,

41
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:05,840
you have to be true to yourself,

42
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,639
true to what's really in your heart.

43
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:38,519
Are you off work yet?

44
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:41,160
Yeah, I just got off.

45
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,399
Are you free?

46
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:45,800
Let's meet up.

47
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,120
Okay, I'll head over.

48
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,759
I'll wait for you at home.

49
00:04:57,959 --> 00:04:58,720
Honestly, these past few days,

50
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,120
I've been wanting to call her.

51
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:02,279
But I know

52
00:05:03,759 --> 00:05:05,279
I can't be who she wants me to be.

53
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,360
Go see her.

54
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,759
Whether you decide to be with her

55
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,360
or stay on the force,

56
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:21,439
I trust your decision will be right.

57
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,240
Just make sure, before you decide,

58
00:05:24,879 --> 00:05:26,959
you know exactly what you're doing.

59
00:05:28,079 --> 00:05:29,839
Be true to your heart,

60
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,000
and leave no regrets.

61
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:36,800
Go on.

62
00:06:04,079 --> 00:06:05,399
Director Huang was here this morning.

63
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,920
He often comes to visit your father.

64
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,319
The truth is, I've never

65
00:06:50,759 --> 00:06:53,160
been able to accept that my father is gone.

66
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,199
I rarely visit him.

67
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,560
Are you still

68
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:10,480
unable to forgive him?

69
00:07:16,319 --> 00:07:17,199
These past two days,

70
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,879
I feel like I've gotten to know my father again.

71
00:07:28,079 --> 00:07:29,319
Back then, all I knew was

72
00:07:30,439 --> 00:07:31,800
that he wouldn't listen to Mom

73
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:35,240
and stubbornly went his own way,

74
00:07:38,199 --> 00:07:39,120
which ultimately led to

75
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,439
us losing our complete family.

76
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:45,800
It wasn't until yesterday that I realized

77
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:48,639
everything he did

78
00:07:50,079 --> 00:07:51,360
wasn't just for others,

79
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,120
but for Mom and me, too.

80
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,040
Everyone here

81
00:08:05,839 --> 00:08:06,560
had a family,

82
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:09,439
and loved ones.

83
00:08:11,839 --> 00:08:12,879
Their sacrifice

84
00:08:14,399 --> 00:08:15,959
was to protect even more families.

85
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,919
I'm really conflicted right now.

86
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:46,200
I've accepted that you're a cop,

87
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,120
but deep down, I have a thousand,

88
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,919
ten thousand worries and fears.

89
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:56,080
I'm scared that if I'm with you,

90
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,399
suddenly one day...

91
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:07,519
I...

92
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,200
If that day really comes,

93
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,799
I hope you can give yourself

94
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,840
a chance to start over.

95
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:36,840
Li Xiao,

96
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,559
can we start over?

97
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,039
This time,

98
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,879
you're a cop,

99
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,600
and I'm a cafe owner.

100
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,759
I know who you are,

101
00:09:55,279 --> 00:09:57,279
but I still want to be with you.

102
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,639
Jiechan State has a complex political background,

103
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:17,320
coupled with its past lawless status,

104
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:19,600
attracting illegal armed groups from abroad

105
00:11:19,799 --> 00:11:21,320
to set up their own plantations

106
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,080
and processing factories here.

107
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,879
During the height of the drug trade,

108
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:27,080
annual drug production in Jiechan State

109
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:28,519
reached as high as 6,000 tons.

110
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,519
Look at the area ahead.

111
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:42,080
This used to be Jesdaporn's plantation.

112
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,360
At the end of the last century,

113
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,200
Jesdaporn was wiped out by The Four Major Families.

114
00:11:46,519 --> 00:11:48,759
In a joint multinational operation, Interpol

115
00:11:49,639 --> 00:11:52,519
completely wiped out the armed forces here.

116
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:05,159
Why are so many in this village disabled?

117
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:21,879
These villagers were once

118
00:12:21,879 --> 00:12:23,639
the ones who grew drugs for Jesdaporn.

119
00:12:24,679 --> 00:12:25,759
Many people assume

120
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:28,519
that everyone in Jiechan State is ruthless.

121
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,360
That's actually not the case.

122
00:12:30,759 --> 00:12:31,919
These villagers are truly pitiful.

123
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,360
Deep down, they never wanted

124
00:12:34,399 --> 00:12:35,919
to grow drugs for Jesdaporn.

125
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,960
Once Jesdaporn found out,

126
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,799
he sent men to sever their hands and feet,

127
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:41,960
and threatened their families.

128
00:12:50,799 --> 00:12:52,440
And after Jesdaporn was taken down?

129
00:12:53,039 --> 00:12:55,600
The Four Major Families and new cartels,

130
00:12:55,759 --> 00:12:58,279
where international forces can't reach,

131
00:12:58,639 --> 00:12:59,960
fought over territory once again

132
00:13:00,559 --> 00:13:01,399
and built new plantations.

133
00:13:01,559 --> 00:13:02,960
That's why global anti-drug agencies

134
00:13:03,399 --> 00:13:04,399
have taken on a new mission.

135
00:13:06,519 --> 00:13:07,840
When will drugs

136
00:13:08,799 --> 00:13:10,919
finally vanish from this world for good?

137
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,279
In this world,

138
00:13:22,559 --> 00:13:24,399
two illegal trades yield the most profit.

139
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,000
The first is arms trafficking,

140
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:27,960
and the second is drugs.

141
00:13:28,519 --> 00:13:30,720
To make more money and make it faster,

142
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,840
some people are always willing to risk it.

143
00:13:37,639 --> 00:13:38,320
Yeah.

144
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:40,600
After fighting drugs for so many years,

145
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,399
I've sometimes wondered

146
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,200
if a day will ever come

147
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:47,559
when justice truly triumphs over evil.

148
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:53,279
To many people, that thought seems naive.

149
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:55,879
Even so,

150
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,000
I still hope that in my lifetime,

151
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:00,720
I'll see drugs disappear from this world.

152
00:14:34,879 --> 00:14:35,639
Mr. Donald,

153
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,399
allow me to introduce them.

154
00:14:37,399 --> 00:14:38,840
This is Zhuang Yan, and this is Ge Dan.

155
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,679
And this is Country M Police's

156
00:14:40,679 --> 00:14:42,120
narcotics expert, Mr. Donald.

157
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:42,840
Pleased to meet you.

158
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:43,879
Nice to meet you.

159
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:44,639
Nice to meet you.

160
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:48,000
Country M police will fully assist you.

161
00:14:48,399 --> 00:14:49,600
Please have a seat.

162
00:15:04,399 --> 00:15:05,919
As for your operation,

163
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:08,200
Mr. Donald will be in full charge.

164
00:15:09,879 --> 00:15:11,080
Let me give you a brief overview.

165
00:15:12,799 --> 00:15:14,240
Ever since ten years ago,

166
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,879
when a multinational op in Jiechan State

167
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:19,399
wiped out several major drug syndicates,

168
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:21,759
new international drug cartels

169
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:23,600
have begun spreading across the region.

170
00:15:23,679 --> 00:15:25,600
The drug trade in Jiechan State

171
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:26,799
is rearing its head again.

172
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:29,360
Right now, the situation we face

173
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,879
is extremely grim.

174
00:15:32,519 --> 00:15:34,440
Country M Police Headquarters

175
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:36,279
has reached a police cooperation agreement

176
00:15:36,279 --> 00:15:43,000
with your country's police.

177
00:15:43,639 --> 00:15:44,879
We invited the two of you here

178
00:15:44,879 --> 00:15:46,960
primarily in hopes that you

179
00:15:47,519 --> 00:15:49,440
can infiltrate the criminal organization,

180
00:15:49,679 --> 00:15:52,080
to secure valuable leads for the drug bust

181
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,840
conducted by China and Country M,

182
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:55,159
and gathering evidence of their crimes.

183
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,000
Mr. Mai mentioned

184
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,440
that Interpol would arrange

185
00:15:58,440 --> 00:16:00,320
for us to enter Hirano Prison.

186
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:02,360
Does that mean during this operation,

187
00:16:03,519 --> 00:16:05,440
we might break the laws of Country M?

188
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:10,000
Your op will be registered as top secret

189
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:11,919
with Interpol,

190
00:16:11,919 --> 00:16:14,039
your country's police,

191
00:16:14,039 --> 00:16:17,120
and Country M Police Headquarters.

192
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,919
However, I wonder, Mr. Zhuang Yan,

193
00:16:18,919 --> 00:16:20,480
how you view the coordination between

194
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:21,559
Country M police and Interpol.

195
00:16:21,559 --> 00:16:22,519
In other words,

196
00:16:22,919 --> 00:16:23,960
for this operation,

197
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,519
all three parties granted maximum freedom,

198
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:27,080
as long as we report and communicate.

199
00:16:27,519 --> 00:16:28,159
Is that correct?

200
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:32,039
As for the specific mission deployment,

201
00:16:32,279 --> 00:16:34,279
we can discuss that privately.

202
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,679
First, let me brief you both on

203
00:16:36,679 --> 00:16:40,840
Jiechan State and Country M's syndicates,

204
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:43,120
and the grim situation we currently face.

205
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,519
Next, as you can see,

206
00:16:44,799 --> 00:16:47,799
the primary targets of your investigation

207
00:16:47,799 --> 00:16:51,720
are the Xiang brothers

208
00:16:53,279 --> 00:16:57,120
and Jesdaporn's son, Theerade.

209
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,200
Where did you go?

210
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,000
I bought some local snacks.

211
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:37,000
Going out alone this late as a girl,

212
00:17:37,519 --> 00:17:38,799
you didn't even show any concern for me.

213
00:17:42,359 --> 00:17:43,000
What are you doing?

214
00:17:45,599 --> 00:17:47,799
Aren't I going to prison in a few days?

215
00:17:48,759 --> 00:17:50,039
I feel like I'm missing something on me.

216
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:51,440
Drawing a tattoo.

217
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:53,960
You sure have plenty of ideas.

218
00:17:55,319 --> 00:17:55,960
With a tattoo,

219
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:58,279
it'll help me pull off the mission better.

220
00:17:58,640 --> 00:17:59,279
Let me draw it for you.

221
00:18:01,279 --> 00:18:02,000
Can you do it?

222
00:18:02,599 --> 00:18:03,119
Sure I can.

223
00:18:05,319 --> 00:18:07,039
What should I draw on you?

224
00:18:09,599 --> 00:18:10,359
Mickey Mouse.

225
00:18:10,359 --> 00:18:10,880
No way.

226
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:12,680
Then...

227
00:18:14,039 --> 00:18:14,799
Born to die.

228
00:18:20,319 --> 00:18:21,200
Live towards death.

229
00:18:21,519 --> 00:18:23,519
Right, live towards death.

230
00:18:28,839 --> 00:18:29,359
What's wrong?

231
00:18:31,680 --> 00:18:32,720
Back in Nanhai City,

232
00:18:34,119 --> 00:18:35,079
whenever we were on a mission,

233
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:37,319
no matter what danger we faced,

234
00:18:37,559 --> 00:18:39,519
our colleagues would back us up instantly.

235
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,279
But this time is different.

236
00:18:43,119 --> 00:18:43,720
Scared?

237
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,160
Then why did you come along?

238
00:18:48,079 --> 00:18:50,039
This is a cross-border operation.

239
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:52,359
It'll definitely be more dangerous.

240
00:18:52,799 --> 00:18:53,960
I'm not scared for myself.

241
00:18:55,759 --> 00:18:56,640
I'm worried about you.

242
00:19:00,599 --> 00:19:01,400
Remember what I said.

243
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:04,079
I will definitely return safe and sound.

244
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:06,720
Trust me.

245
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:13,319
Besides,

246
00:19:14,079 --> 00:19:15,799
we have a strong motherland backing us up,

247
00:19:16,039 --> 00:19:16,519
don't we?

248
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:21,680
You said it.

249
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:24,359
Don't lie to me.

250
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:25,880
I said it.

251
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:27,839
I'm not lying.

252
00:19:29,839 --> 00:19:30,880
And in this world,

253
00:19:31,519 --> 00:19:32,920
evil will never triumph over good.

254
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:37,000
Still, since coming out here,

255
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:39,680
you've really changed quite a bit.

256
00:19:44,839 --> 00:19:46,160
Not as rigid as you used to be.

257
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:48,000
My identity is different now, isn't it?

258
00:19:53,559 --> 00:19:54,160
Don't be sad.

259
00:19:54,759 --> 00:19:55,240
Go on, draw it.

260
00:20:49,519 --> 00:20:51,519
Before going to the Financial Tower,

261
00:20:51,599 --> 00:20:52,559
Liang Wenbiao took two calls.

262
00:20:53,079 --> 00:20:54,240
I suspect that in this deal,

263
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:55,200
besides Li Qiang,

264
00:20:55,599 --> 00:20:57,240
someone else is involved.

265
00:20:59,559 --> 00:21:00,680
Do you have any suspects?

266
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:04,799
Before Liang Wenbiao met Li Qiang,

267
00:21:04,799 --> 00:21:06,400
someone was already supplying him.

268
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,720
Ever since I met Four-Legged Snake,

269
00:21:09,079 --> 00:21:10,000
I've been suspecting...

270
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:12,240
that Liang Wenbiao's supplier

271
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:13,200
might very well be Four-Legged Snake.

272
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:16,240
He might be more than just a supplier.

273
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:21,759
Is it possible to use Liang Wenbiao

274
00:21:22,119 --> 00:21:23,839
to dig up more on Four-Legged Snake?

275
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,319
Liang Wenbiao is extremely cautious.

276
00:21:26,839 --> 00:21:28,640
Every time he meets Four-Legged Snake,

277
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:30,119
he never lets anyone overhear

278
00:21:30,119 --> 00:21:30,920
their conversation.

279
00:21:31,599 --> 00:21:34,400
If we want more intel on Four-Legged Snake,

280
00:21:35,359 --> 00:21:36,799
we'll have to wait for another opening.

281
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:44,319
Two of our officers went to Country M

282
00:21:45,160 --> 00:21:47,359
targeting Ma Jingrong and his crew.

283
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,559
If Li Qiang flees to Country M,

284
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:51,839
their covers could easily be blown.

285
00:21:52,160 --> 00:21:53,640
So our top priority right now

286
00:21:54,319 --> 00:21:55,960
is to stay on Liang Wenbiao's trail

287
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:58,079
and capture Li Qiang as soon as possible.

288
00:21:58,680 --> 00:21:59,960
Now that this deal fell through,

289
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:02,519
Liang Wenbiao will be even more guarded.

290
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:05,039
He's already begun to suspect

291
00:22:05,279 --> 00:22:07,039
there's an undercover cop around him.

292
00:22:08,640 --> 00:22:09,400
Does he suspect you?

293
00:22:10,960 --> 00:22:11,799
Not for now.

294
00:22:15,720 --> 00:22:17,400
Don't make any reckless moves for now.

295
00:22:17,559 --> 00:22:18,440
All we have to do is wait

296
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:19,680
for Liang Wenbiao's next deal.

297
00:22:20,519 --> 00:22:21,160
Also,

298
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:23,319
during Liang Wenbiao's next deal,

299
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:25,559
he'll definitely take your phones again.

300
00:22:26,319 --> 00:22:27,079
Find an opportunity

301
00:22:27,920 --> 00:22:30,640
to plant this tracker on his car.

302
00:22:33,319 --> 00:22:35,599
There's a new number on this phone.

303
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:37,680
Call your family

304
00:22:37,759 --> 00:22:38,559
and let them know you're safe.

305
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:40,599
Remember to destroy the number afterward.

306
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:49,079
I know you're still worried about her,

307
00:22:49,880 --> 00:22:51,079
so I went to check on her.

308
00:22:51,759 --> 00:22:53,119
She's doing well right now.

309
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:54,839
Don't worry too much.

310
00:22:57,359 --> 00:22:57,880
Thank you.

311
00:23:10,640 --> 00:23:11,400
Daddy.

312
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:12,559
Daddy, it's Xiaoshu.

313
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:13,480
What's wrong?

314
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:14,720
When are you coming home?

315
00:23:15,599 --> 00:23:16,240
Daddy?

316
00:23:17,279 --> 00:23:18,160
Be good, Xiaoshu.

317
00:23:19,839 --> 00:23:21,279
Let Mommy talk to Daddy.

318
00:23:42,359 --> 00:23:42,960
I'm fine.

319
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:44,480
Nothing's wrong.

320
00:23:46,839 --> 00:23:49,160
Are you all doing okay now?

321
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:51,039
Same as always.

322
00:24:02,599 --> 00:24:03,119
I know.

323
00:24:04,960 --> 00:24:06,279
It's too late to say anything now.

324
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:07,880
I'm the one who hurt you both.

325
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:17,119
Please.

326
00:24:18,839 --> 00:24:21,160
Please make sure to

327
00:24:21,519 --> 00:24:23,160
raise our daughter well.

328
00:24:23,920 --> 00:24:24,720
You already said that

329
00:24:25,279 --> 00:24:27,440
back when we got divorced.

330
00:24:34,400 --> 00:24:35,000
I know.

331
00:24:36,640 --> 00:24:37,720
I ruined your lives.

332
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:42,079
It's all my fault.

333
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:50,720
Why?

334
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:53,839
Why do people only cherish what they have

335
00:24:55,279 --> 00:24:56,599
after it's gone?

336
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:11,839
Your mom asked about you.

337
00:25:13,640 --> 00:25:15,279
I didn't even know what to tell her.

338
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:19,359
Don't tell her about my situation yet.

339
00:26:21,119 --> 00:26:23,119
But she'll find out eventually.

340
00:26:38,519 --> 00:26:40,079
I want to say a few words to Xiaoshu.

341
00:26:41,359 --> 00:26:43,119
Come here, Daddy wants to talk to you.

342
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:46,079
Daddy.

343
00:26:48,920 --> 00:26:49,400
Xiaoshu.

344
00:26:51,039 --> 00:26:52,519
What Daddy told you last time,

345
00:26:53,640 --> 00:26:54,640
do you still remember?

346
00:26:55,319 --> 00:26:56,680
You must always listen to Mommy

347
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:58,359
and not make her worry.

348
00:26:58,960 --> 00:26:59,440
Remember that, okay?

349
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:00,640
I will.

350
00:27:06,079 --> 00:27:06,680
Daddy,

351
00:27:07,359 --> 00:27:09,200
when are you coming home?

352
00:27:27,119 --> 00:27:28,119
Xiaoshu, listen to me.

353
00:27:30,759 --> 00:27:31,920
Dad did something wrong.

354
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:33,240
From now on,

355
00:27:34,559 --> 00:27:36,160
I can never come home again.

356
00:27:41,359 --> 00:27:44,079
I know Xiaoshu is now

357
00:27:44,440 --> 00:27:46,240
a sensible big girl.

358
00:27:47,319 --> 00:27:48,119
Promise Dad,

359
00:27:49,319 --> 00:27:50,279
from now on, in my place,

360
00:27:50,720 --> 00:27:51,960
you'll take good care of Mom,

361
00:27:52,680 --> 00:27:53,799
and take good care of yourself.

362
00:27:54,319 --> 00:27:55,440
Only then can Dad rest easy.

363
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:57,240
Promise Dad.

364
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:00,519
Okay.

365
00:28:10,720 --> 00:28:11,440
Daddy!

366
00:28:11,440 --> 00:28:12,960
Daddy, don't go!

367
00:28:12,960 --> 00:28:13,960
I want Daddy!

368
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:16,240
I want Daddy!

369
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:18,240
I want Daddy!

370
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:21,559
Tell Daddy to come back!

371
00:28:22,279 --> 00:28:24,640
Tell Daddy to come back, Mommy!

372
00:28:24,640 --> 00:28:26,599
I want Daddy!

373
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:29,640
I want Daddy!

374
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:40,079
Thank you

375
00:28:40,839 --> 00:28:42,799
for letting me see my family.

376
00:28:47,759 --> 00:28:48,559
What we promised you,

377
00:28:48,559 --> 00:28:50,039
we'll definitely do our best to fulfill.

378
00:28:50,039 --> 00:28:51,599
However, your previous statements

379
00:28:52,200 --> 00:28:53,880
had a lot of contradictions.

380
00:28:57,240 --> 00:28:58,920
You should be ready now

381
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,160
to come clean, right?

382
00:29:07,839 --> 00:29:08,599
I'm ready.

383
00:29:09,839 --> 00:29:11,640
Everything that I know,

384
00:29:12,079 --> 00:29:13,759
I will tell you the honest truth.

385
00:29:13,759 --> 00:29:14,839
Ask me anything.

386
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:21,559
How do you know Cheng Weimin?

387
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:25,000
I don't know Cheng Weimin at all.

388
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:30,400
Someone else arranged your deals?

389
00:29:31,759 --> 00:29:32,640
It was actually simple.

390
00:29:33,960 --> 00:29:35,400
Cheng Weimin used the logistics company

391
00:29:35,759 --> 00:29:37,440
to ship drugs to Gao Min's address.

392
00:29:38,119 --> 00:29:39,319
Once I received the shipment,

393
00:29:39,519 --> 00:29:40,559
I'd hand it over to my buyer.

394
00:29:40,759 --> 00:29:41,880
Once the buyer got the goods,

395
00:29:42,039 --> 00:29:43,640
they wired the money directly

396
00:29:43,640 --> 00:29:45,160
into my Alipay account.

397
00:29:45,319 --> 00:29:47,119
Then I'd withdraw the cash for my boss.

398
00:29:48,519 --> 00:29:51,240
By "boss," you mean Four-Legged Snake,

399
00:29:51,240 --> 00:29:51,720
right?

400
00:29:53,359 --> 00:29:55,359
I have no idea who Four-Legged Snake is.

401
00:29:56,279 --> 00:29:57,880
The man who arranged all this for me

402
00:29:58,680 --> 00:29:59,640
was named Chen Hai.

403
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:07,240
You mean Chen Hai from Longze Group?

404
00:30:08,039 --> 00:30:08,519
Yes.

405
00:30:09,839 --> 00:30:11,400
You were right about one thing:

406
00:30:11,400 --> 00:30:12,960
inside Zhongtian Logistics,

407
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:15,119
someone was indeed helping us traffic drugs.

408
00:30:16,519 --> 00:30:17,240
Who was it?

409
00:30:18,519 --> 00:30:20,400
I don't really know exactly who it was.

410
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:24,440
Back when Chen Hai approached me

411
00:30:24,759 --> 00:30:26,160
to do this job for him,

412
00:30:26,839 --> 00:30:27,880
he told me

413
00:30:28,640 --> 00:30:30,400
that over at Zhongtian Logistics,

414
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:33,000
he spent a fortune bribing people.

415
00:30:33,839 --> 00:30:34,960
It was completely safe and foolproof.

416
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:37,079
That's why through Zhongtian Logistics,

417
00:30:37,079 --> 00:30:38,400
the drugs shipped to Nanhai

418
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:40,799
were never once inspected.

419
00:30:42,359 --> 00:30:44,200
You claim Chen Hai and the logistics company

420
00:30:44,200 --> 00:30:45,119
had an insider deal,

421
00:30:45,799 --> 00:30:47,920
yet the one who signed the contract

422
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:48,920
was you.

423
00:30:50,519 --> 00:30:52,160
That was just a formality.

424
00:30:53,799 --> 00:30:55,000
To cover their tracks,

425
00:30:55,920 --> 00:30:57,400
they naturally handled the paperwork

426
00:30:57,400 --> 00:30:58,079
properly.

427
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:00,119
The person who signed with me

428
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:01,519
was named Zhou Fuhai.

429
00:31:02,440 --> 00:31:03,599
Although I can't be sure,

430
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:05,119
I can tell

431
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:07,559
that inside Zhongtian Logistics,

432
00:31:07,880 --> 00:31:09,079
the one colluding with Chen Hai

433
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:10,720
is most likely him.

434
00:31:18,839 --> 00:31:19,880
This list of buyers...

435
00:31:21,240 --> 00:31:22,319
...is the one you gave us earlier.

436
00:31:22,319 --> 00:31:23,240
Take another look.

437
00:31:23,880 --> 00:31:24,799
Did you leave anyone out?

438
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:29,039
These are just the downlines I developed.

439
00:31:29,160 --> 00:31:30,519
Every time I received a shipment,

440
00:31:30,880 --> 00:31:33,039
I'd hand part of it to Chen Hai's contact.

441
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:34,680
They were usually large orders.

442
00:31:35,319 --> 00:31:37,200
Chen Hai is extremely cautious.

443
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:40,359
He designs the deal to be highly complex.

444
00:31:41,039 --> 00:31:42,400
In this transaction chain,

445
00:31:42,400 --> 00:31:43,240
everyone

446
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:45,519
knows exactly what they're supposed to do.

447
00:31:45,759 --> 00:31:46,599
Once something goes wrong,

448
00:31:47,240 --> 00:31:49,039
all he needs to do is cut off

449
00:31:49,039 --> 00:31:50,119
a single link in the chain.

450
00:31:51,279 --> 00:31:52,119
That way, you police officers

451
00:31:52,799 --> 00:31:54,279
can almost never trace it back to him.

452
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:57,039
So you're saying

453
00:31:57,680 --> 00:31:59,160
the kidnapping of your ex-wife

454
00:31:59,599 --> 00:32:00,799
was also arranged by Chen Hai?

455
00:32:03,759 --> 00:32:05,319
Him sending people to kidnap my ex-wife...

456
00:32:05,319 --> 00:32:06,880
I really didn't expect that at all.

457
00:32:07,119 --> 00:32:08,000
At first, I thought

458
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,400
he'd send someone to silence me.

459
00:32:10,160 --> 00:32:11,240
But then I thought about it,

460
00:32:12,359 --> 00:32:13,119
and it makes sense.

461
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:14,240
If I died,

462
00:32:15,079 --> 00:32:16,319
you would keep investigating.

463
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:17,839
But if I took all the blame

464
00:32:17,839 --> 00:32:19,000
on myself,

465
00:32:19,960 --> 00:32:22,079
maybe the police would close the case.

466
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:23,960
Then he'd be safe.

467
00:32:24,480 --> 00:32:25,960
I think he never expected

468
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:27,680
that you police would so quickly

469
00:32:27,680 --> 00:32:29,400
round up all the kidnappers.

470
00:32:32,160 --> 00:32:32,799
To be honest,

471
00:32:32,799 --> 00:32:33,920
if it weren't for that,

472
00:32:34,640 --> 00:32:35,640
I wouldn't have had the guts

473
00:32:35,640 --> 00:32:37,000
to confess and give up Chen Hai.

474
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:39,480
Then between your escape

475
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:41,119
and when we tracked you down,

476
00:32:41,359 --> 00:32:43,160
did you contact Chen Hai's people?

477
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:45,200
No.

478
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:47,279
Ever since the day the shipment was lost,

479
00:32:47,960 --> 00:32:48,960
I knew that I

480
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:50,640
was in massive trouble.

481
00:32:50,839 --> 00:32:53,279
I haven't dealt much with Chen Hai,

482
00:32:53,519 --> 00:32:54,720
but I can tell

483
00:32:55,720 --> 00:32:58,759
there's a more powerful force behind him.

484
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:08,119
I figured it out long ago.

485
00:33:08,799 --> 00:33:10,400
Whether I fall into Chen Hai's hands

486
00:33:11,839 --> 00:33:13,160
or end up with you cops,

487
00:33:15,359 --> 00:33:16,599
I'm a dead man either way.

488
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,160
So you decided to run.

489
00:33:20,119 --> 00:33:21,000
If not for wanting

490
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:22,480
to see my daughter one last time,

491
00:33:24,160 --> 00:33:26,200
I'd have left here long ago.

492
00:33:30,920 --> 00:33:32,720
I think you're being far too naive.

493
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,240
You knew

494
00:33:34,359 --> 00:33:36,079
we'd definitely find you, right?

495
00:33:46,440 --> 00:33:47,519
There are things

496
00:33:47,680 --> 00:33:49,480
you might not fully understand yet.

497
00:33:52,440 --> 00:33:53,599
What you're about to deal with

498
00:33:56,119 --> 00:33:58,000
isn't an ordinary criminal organization,

499
00:33:58,599 --> 00:34:01,519
but a massive black hole filled with evil.

500
00:34:02,519 --> 00:34:03,759
Before upholding justice,

501
00:34:05,440 --> 00:34:07,200
you'd better protect yourselves first,

502
00:34:08,599 --> 00:34:10,519
so this black hole doesn't swallow you.

503
00:34:12,519 --> 00:34:13,320
Thank you for the warning.

504
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:14,840
But I firmly believe

505
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:18,039
justice will prevail over evil in the end.

506
00:34:34,840 --> 00:34:35,800
Tonight,

507
00:34:36,119 --> 00:34:39,039
move all this product for me.

508
00:34:39,480 --> 00:34:40,199
Understood?

509
00:34:56,639 --> 00:34:57,960
Boss, what's going on?

510
00:34:58,559 --> 00:35:00,199
Something happened to Yunfei in Jiangyang.

511
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:04,000
What do we do now?

512
00:35:05,679 --> 00:35:06,119
Boss...

513
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:08,039
Why don't we stay out of this?

514
00:35:08,400 --> 00:35:09,679
Mr. Ma isn't one of us anyway.

515
00:35:11,880 --> 00:35:14,079
After all, I did introduce Ma Jingrong to Theerade.

516
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:15,199
Now that things have gone south,

517
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:18,639
Jiang Liye definitely won't let us off.

518
00:35:19,159 --> 00:35:19,880
You can't go in!

519
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:30,360
Mr. Theerade wants you tomorrow morning

520
00:35:30,719 --> 00:35:31,920
to go see Mr. Jiang.

521
00:35:32,039 --> 00:35:33,599
Did you really have to make such a fuss?

522
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:36,519
Even if Mr. Jiang hadn't summoned me,

523
00:35:37,360 --> 00:35:39,039
I would still go see him.

524
00:35:40,800 --> 00:35:41,199
Fine.

525
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:43,800
I believe you.

526
00:35:44,400 --> 00:35:46,199
Before 12:00 noon tomorrow.

527
00:35:47,639 --> 00:35:48,400
Don't be late.

528
00:35:53,159 --> 00:35:53,599
Let's go.

529
00:36:03,360 --> 00:36:05,039
Boss, what do we do now?

530
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:07,039
Why don't we go lay low for a while?

531
00:36:08,320 --> 00:36:09,039
We can't hide.

532
00:36:10,440 --> 00:36:12,840
Hiding is a dead end.

533
00:36:50,559 --> 00:36:51,320
Mr. Jiang.

534
00:36:59,559 --> 00:37:00,679
Her husband's in prison,

535
00:37:02,159 --> 00:37:04,480
yet this woman seems quite at ease.

536
00:37:06,880 --> 00:37:08,880
Knowing they're about to die, some people

537
00:37:09,199 --> 00:37:10,360
they panic.

538
00:37:11,559 --> 00:37:14,800
Others seize their final moments

539
00:37:15,280 --> 00:37:16,280
to enjoy themselves.

540
00:37:19,559 --> 00:37:20,840
This woman is far from simple.

541
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:12,400
Mr. Jiang.

542
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:16,159
I've looked into President Ma's situation.

543
00:38:17,320 --> 00:38:19,400
Police are holding him in Hirano Prison.

544
00:38:20,679 --> 00:38:23,239
I'll find a way to get him out soon.

545
00:38:24,559 --> 00:38:25,760
Do you really have what it takes?

546
00:38:26,960 --> 00:38:28,119
The national treasure theft...

547
00:38:28,239 --> 00:38:30,400
isn't something money alone can fix.

548
00:38:31,119 --> 00:38:31,960
The national treasure theft

549
00:38:31,960 --> 00:38:33,840
had nothing to do with us anyway.

550
00:38:34,320 --> 00:38:36,639
Besides, the police have no evidence

551
00:38:36,639 --> 00:38:37,400
to charge President Ma.

552
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:38,719
Whether Ma Jingrong lives or dies

553
00:38:38,719 --> 00:38:40,079
is none of my concern.

554
00:38:40,199 --> 00:38:41,239
What I care about is

555
00:38:41,880 --> 00:38:43,119
that my goods are gone.

556
00:38:43,679 --> 00:38:45,079
How do you plan to settle this?

557
00:38:49,800 --> 00:38:50,360
Mr. Jiang,

558
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:52,280
we were just the middlemen

559
00:38:52,280 --> 00:38:53,280
who connected you two in business.

560
00:38:53,559 --> 00:38:55,559
You can't take all the profits

561
00:38:56,079 --> 00:38:57,280
and leave us to take the fall.

562
00:38:57,360 --> 00:38:57,920
Jin Qiang!

563
00:38:59,920 --> 00:39:01,239
Don't speak to Mr. Jiang like that!

564
00:39:09,480 --> 00:39:11,679
Young men act and speak rashly.

565
00:39:11,679 --> 00:39:12,440
It's understandable.

566
00:39:15,000 --> 00:39:15,800
Back in the day,

567
00:39:16,440 --> 00:39:17,559
when I was in Los Angeles,

568
00:39:18,440 --> 00:39:19,559
it was me against three guys.

569
00:39:21,440 --> 00:39:25,239
I grabbed a knife and charged right in.

570
00:39:26,000 --> 00:39:27,000
When the fight was over,

571
00:39:28,079 --> 00:39:28,800
guess how many of us

572
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:32,639
ended up in the hospital?

573
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:35,559
With how formidable you are, Mr. Jiang,

574
00:39:36,039 --> 00:39:38,519
you must have taken down all three.

575
00:39:38,599 --> 00:39:38,960
Wrong.

576
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:42,320
Only one person went to the hospital.

577
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:44,599
And that was me.

578
00:39:49,840 --> 00:39:50,679
Back then,

579
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:53,559
just to show off some reckless bravado,

580
00:39:53,840 --> 00:39:56,880
I lay in a hospital bed for six months.

581
00:39:58,320 --> 00:40:00,400
Ever since, I realized

582
00:40:01,880 --> 00:40:03,880
that surviving in this world

583
00:40:06,360 --> 00:40:08,920
isn't about who's tougher than whom.

584
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:18,800
It's about who reads the situation better.

585
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:22,519
Mr. Jiang—

586
00:40:31,760 --> 00:40:33,119
"You're just middlemen

587
00:40:33,639 --> 00:40:34,840
who introduced a deal"?

588
00:40:35,800 --> 00:40:38,239
You chose to work with Ma Jingrong.

589
00:40:38,920 --> 00:40:40,480
Now you've lost my goods,

590
00:40:40,480 --> 00:40:41,400
so when I come looking for you,

591
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:43,599
am I in the wrong?

592
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:46,559
Mr. Jiang, regarding this matter,

593
00:40:48,239 --> 00:40:49,599
I will take full responsibility.

594
00:41:07,079 --> 00:41:09,159
Ma Jingrong's man was caught in Jiangyang.

595
00:41:09,159 --> 00:41:10,599
This is no simple matter.

596
00:41:12,000 --> 00:41:14,119
Is Ma Jingrong truly clean?

597
00:41:14,119 --> 00:41:15,480
I need an explanation.

598
00:41:15,760 --> 00:41:18,159
Mr. Theerade needs an explanation too.

599
00:41:19,119 --> 00:41:20,480
I'll give you two weeks.

600
00:41:22,199 --> 00:41:23,239
Don't worry, Mr. Jiang.

601
00:41:24,480 --> 00:41:27,400
I'll see this through to the end.

602
00:41:31,559 --> 00:41:32,000
All right.

603
00:41:35,599 --> 00:41:39,679
Care to stay for a casual bite?

604
00:41:42,920 --> 00:41:43,400
No, thank you.

605
00:41:44,760 --> 00:41:45,679
Thanks for the kind offer.

606
00:41:46,599 --> 00:41:47,960
What Mr. Jiang asked of us,

607
00:41:48,719 --> 00:41:50,400
we must resolve right away.

608
00:42:14,280 --> 00:42:15,199
What about this woman?

609
00:42:16,559 --> 00:42:17,199
Keep her for now.

610
00:42:18,559 --> 00:42:19,760
Maybe that guy Ma

611
00:42:20,599 --> 00:42:22,000
has what it takes to get out.

612
00:42:41,639 --> 00:42:42,119
Chinese?

613
00:42:43,199 --> 00:42:43,800
Chinese.

614
00:42:44,679 --> 00:42:45,599
What are you looking at?

615
00:42:45,840 --> 00:42:46,440
Pick it up.

616
00:42:47,280 --> 00:42:47,880
Pick it up!

617
00:42:49,159 --> 00:42:49,880
Clean it up.

618
00:43:31,320 --> 00:43:33,320
Eat up, Chinese.
